'' ===========================================================================
''
''   File.......  ch03-inline-pasm-toggle.spin2
''   Purpose....  The same blink with one native instruction dropped
''                inline, showing where Spin2 ends and PASM2 begins
''   Manual.....  Getting Started with the Propeller 2
''   Version....  v1.0.3 (2026-08-08)
''   Appears in.  Chapter 3: Putting It to Work -- Spin2 or PASM2? A
''                decision, not a syntax tour
''   Authors....  Iron Sheep Productions, LLC
''   E-mail.....  stephen@ironsheep.biz
''   Started....  Jun 2026
''   Updated....  Jul 2026
''
''   This file is an EXAMPLE from the manual above. Everything below
''   this header is byte-identical to the listing printed there --
''   what you read in the manual is what builds here.
''
'' ===========================================================================

CON
  _clkfreq = 200_000_000
  LED      = 56

PUB main()
  repeat
    toggleFast(LED)
    waitms(250)

PRI toggleFast(pin)
  org
    drvnot  pin                 ' one native instruction, full speed
  end

